sty:Classic a sty:Theme ; sem:slug "classic" ; sem:order 8 ; sem:symbol "⊞" ;
    rdfs:label "Classic"@en , "Класика"@uk , "Klassisch"@de , "كلاسيكي"@ar ;
    rdfs:comment "Silver faces and two-pixel bevels (Windows 95-ish): white-and-grey edges raise every button and sink every field, navy caption bars carry square caption buttons on the right, toggles push in, selections are navy, the taskbar runs along the bottom; small sans type, no corners, no easing. Slate by night."@en ;
